    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clarke Auctioneers are proud to present 21 The Hazels, a truly exceptional property. This stunning 3-bedroom semi-detached residence is perfectly positioned within a quiet cul-de-sac in the highly desirable Ballinahinch Wood development, located in the picturesque village of Ashford, Co. Wicklow. The home offers generous and beautifully proportioned accommodation spanning approximately 109 sq m (1,172 sq ft). \n\nNo. 21 The Hazels is a stunning, A-rated family home completed in 2020 and presented in absolute showhouse condition. Thoughtfully decorated to the highest standards by its current owners, this property exudes elegance and style throughout. Properties within the highly sought-after Ballinahinch Wood development rarely come to the market and are typically snapped up quickly. As such, No. 21 is expected to attract strong interest from a wide variety of prospective buyers.\n\nThe ground floor opens into a bright, welcoming entrance hallway leading to a cosy yet elegant living room complete with stylish fitted storage units. To the rear, a beautiful, light-filled open-plan kitchen and dining area overlooks the generous, West-facing rear garden. A spacious guest WC and a practical utility room complete the downstairs layout. Upstairs, there are three beautifully appointed bedrooms, including a wonderful master suite with an en-suite bathroom, alongside a contemporary family bathroom. Every detail of this home has been curated to the highest specification, featuring premium carpets, tiles, flooring, light fittings, curtains, and blinds.\n\nDesigned for maximum energy efficiency, this A2-rated home features high levels of insulation and an innovative Panasonic air-to-water heat pump with zoned controls. Outside, the front driveway is beautifully cobble-locked with parking space for two cars. The West-facing rear garden, accessed via French doors from the kitchen, is an ideal landscaped space for outdoor entertaining. It features a sunny patio, garden shed, manicured lawns, and mature flower beds. The Hazels is an exclusive, low-density enclave within Ballinahinch Wood, offering residents access to beautifully landscaped green areas. \n\nThe development sits within short walking distance of Ashford village centre and its excellent local amenities. Renowned for its scenic countryside, the Ashford area boasts award-winning beaches, forest walks, and close proximity to the majestic Wicklow Mountains. The world-famous Mount Usher Gardens, along with the Avoca café and food market, are right on your doorstep. For commuters, direct bus services run from the village, Dart services are accessible from nearby Greystones, and the M11 ensures South Dublin and the M50 are just a 25-minute drive away."
      },
